    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont really want to go to the er or anything if i can help it, it's so expensive and the wait is always insane. do u think it's really that serious? i mean i can just take some advil and try to stretch it out a bit, surely i cant do more damage by just trying to loosen the muscles up? it feels like it's just a tight muscle causing the nerve thing",
